{
  "format": "libre-panel-theme/1",
  "name": "SPUR II Round report",
  "collection": "SPUR II",
  "author": "Libre Panel",
  "license": "GPL-3.0-or-later",
  "description": "SPUR II's round report for 1920x480 bar panels: what the memory service shows after a game. The frame rate against the average of your last rounds of the same game, how much of the round ran at which frame rate (a line under each bar marks the earlier rounds), who held the rate down, and the highest temperatures and power against those rounds. Libre Panel's own round report (round-report) is the default; choose this one with report_theme = \"spur-round-report\".",
